					"marks": [
						{
							"type": "code"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": ") across Chromium, Firefox, and WebKit: a light-DOM Svelte consumer and a Web Component IIFE page render and theme correctly, a plugin installs styles via the nonce fallback path, and the page records zero "
				},
